su name say internal ob name text payload be ceremony def
  exists su name cmd ob text "node command/piper_say_runner.mjs" be text ya
  ob name payload to filename "/tmp/pyash-piper-input.txt" be write do
  ob text of cmd from filename "/tmp/pyash-piper-input.txt" be command do
  su name result ret
prah
su name say ob text payload be ceremony def
  ob text of ob of this to name text input be text do
  ob name input be say internal do
